{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "percentage-bar",
  "title": "Percentage bar",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 6,
  "summary": {
    "en": "One horizontal bar split into up to four colored parts that add up to 100 %, with a legend that names each part and its share. The compact way to show composition.",
    "id": "Satu batang horizontal yang dibagi menjadi paling banyak empat bagian berwarna yang berjumlah 100 %, dengan legenda yang menyebut nama dan porsi setiap bagian. Cara ringkas untuk menunjukkan komposisi."
  },
  "titleId": "Percentage bar",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Composition of a whole",
        "desc": "Credits by course type. The legend carries the numbers.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Where do my credits go?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Share of 120 credits by course type</div></div>\n  <div class=\"pbar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Core 50 percent, electives 25, labs 15, general 10\"><span style=\"flex-grow: 50; background: var(--series-1);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 25; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 15; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 10; background: var(--series-4);\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-1);\"></i>Core <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">50%</b></span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-2);\"></i>Electives <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">25%</b></span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-3);\"></i>Labs <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">15%</b></span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4);\"></i>General <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">10%</b></span></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Compared across rows",
        "desc": "Answers in two tryouts. Same parts, same order, one bar per row; a change in the split reads at a glance.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Am I answering more correctly?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Answers in the last two tryouts</div></div>\n  <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 6px;\"><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Tryout 3</span><div class=\"pbar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tryout 3: 62 percent right, 28 wrong, 10 skipped\"><span style=\"flex-grow: 62; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 28; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 10; background: var(--series-4);\"></span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 6px;\"><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Tryout 4</span><div class=\"pbar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tryout 4: 74 percent right, 20 wrong, 6 skipped\"><span style=\"flex-grow: 74; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 20; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 6; background: var(--series-4);\"></span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-3);\"></i>Right</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-2);\"></i>Wrong</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4);\"></i>Skipped</span></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Komposisi satu keseluruhan",
        "desc": "Anggaran kelurahan per bidang. Legenda membawa angkanya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Ke mana anggaran kelurahan dipakai?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Porsi anggaran per bidang, tahun 2026</div></div>\n  <div class=\"pbar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pembangunan 50 persen, pelayanan 25, pemberdayaan 15, lainnya 10\"><span style=\"flex-grow: 50; background: var(--series-1);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 25; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 15; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 10; background: var(--series-4);\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-1);\"></i>Pembangunan <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">50%</b></span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-2);\"></i>Pelayanan <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">25%</b></span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-3);\"></i>Pemberdayaan <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">15%</b></span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4);\"></i>Lainnya <b style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-strong);\">10%</b></span></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dibandingkan antarbaris",
        "desc": "Status laporan warga di dua triwulan. Bagian sama, urutan sama, satu batang per baris; perubahan pembagiannya terbaca sekilas.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Apakah lebih banyak laporan yang selesai?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Status laporan warga, dua triwulan terakhir</div></div>\n  <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 6px;\"><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Triwulan II</span><div class=\"pbar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Triwulan II: 62 persen selesai, 28 diproses, 10 ditolak\"><span style=\"flex-grow: 62; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 28; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 10; background: var(--series-4);\"></span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--gap: 6px;\"><span class=\"card__sub\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Triwulan III</span><div class=\"pbar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Triwulan III: 74 persen selesai, 20 diproses, 6 ditolak\"><span style=\"flex-grow: 74; background: var(--series-3);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 20; background: var(--series-2);\"></span><span style=\"flex-grow: 6; background: var(--series-4);\"></span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-3);\"></i>Selesai</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-2);\"></i>Diproses</span><span><i style=\"background: var(--series-4);\"></i>Ditolak</span></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
